# MCPB packs a self-contained bundle: manifest.json + the built dist/ + the
# runtime node_modules. Exclude TypeScript source, tests, and dev-only config.
# Patterns are anchored to the bundle root (leading /) so they DON'T match
# node_modules internals — the bundle must ship complete runtime dependencies.
/src/
/test/
/tsconfig.json
/smithery.yaml
/server.json
/.gitignore
/.mcpbignore
*.mcpb
